OL,3,GNEWSAPartnership aims to develop
OL,4,Adefence sector skills
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcademics in Lincolnshire say a new
OL,7,Fpartnership could help develop skills,
OL,8,Finnovation and opportunities within the
OL,9,Fdefence and security sector.
OL,11,FLincoln College Group, which runs
OL,12,FLincoln College, Newark College and the
OL,13,FAir & Space Institute, is joining
OL,14,Fforces with the University of Lincoln.
OL,16,FOfficials want to make it easier to
OL,17,Fmove between further and higher
OL,18,Feducation and on to employment.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
