OL,3,GNEWSAPartnership aims to develop
OL,4,Adefence sector skills
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Locking, the chief executive of
OL,7,FLincoln College Group, said the
OL,8,Fpartnership would offer a clearer
OL,9,Fpathway for young people who are
OL,10,Flooking at a career in the defence
OL,11,Findustry.
